OL,3,GNEWSAIdeas from children wanted in
OL,4,Aredesign of park
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren and young people are being
OL,7,Fasked to help shape the future of a
OL,8,Fpark through a public design
OL,9,Fcompetition.
OL,11,FSt Helier's parish authority has
OL,12,Flaunched the initiative to gather ideas
OL,13,Ffor improving Jersey's St Andrew's
OL,14,FPark, also known as Tower Park, which
OL,15,Fit said was in need of "investment and
OL,16,Ffresh thinking".
