OL,3,GNEWSAIdeas from children wanted in
OL,4,Aredesign of park
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs part of a consultation, children and
OL,7,Fyoung adults are being encouraged to
OL,8,Fsubmit drawings, plans and videos
OL,9,Fshowing their vision for the site, with
OL,10,Fprizes to be given to winning entries
OL,11,Fduring an event at St Helier Town Hall
OL,12,Fin November.
OL,14,FThe consultation closes on 11 October,
OL,15,Fwith entries accepted both online and
OL,16,Fin person.
